DESCRIPTION

  libyaml is a YAML 1.1 parser and emitter written in C.

SOURCE

  https://github.com/yaml/libyaml/archive/refs/tags/0.2.5.tar.gz

VERSION

  0.2.5

LICENSE

  MIT

PURPOSE

  YAML parser for Ruby's psych extension, required by RubyGems for
  parsing checksums.yaml.gz files inside gem archives.

LOCAL CHANGES

  None yet. Using upstream source as-is.
